Turnip (Mesa freedreno Vulkan, msm KMD) on iOS 16 over the RedwoodGPU user client (userland/negronigl/drm, copied
to src/redwood-drm by scripts/gpu/turnip-build.sh): device discovery without DRM nodes, IOConnectMapMemory64 maps,
no fd-based external handles, VK_EXT_external_memory_host (HOST_CACHED types; noted IOSurfaces by ID, other pages via USERPTR 0x49), no CTR_EL0 read at EL0, relative
condition-variable waits, chained fixups. Applies after the HackiOS patches (scripts/gpu/env.sh HACKIOS_PATCHES).

